  tutorialDescriptions:
  - 'Resource Tracker

    Press (space/right stick) while holding an item to locate the nearest natural instance of that item.'
  - 'Sidestep

    Press (space/right stick) while moving to gain a short burst of speed.'
  - 'Hypersprint

    Hold (space/right stick) and release when fully charged to unleash a burst of speed towards your cursor.'
  - 'Divine Guard

    Press (space/right stick) to briefly become invincible and damage enemies on contact.'
  - 'Vortex Cleave

    Press (space/right stick) to perform a spinning attack that deals extra damage.'
