  savedPlayerHealth: 0
  loadingTips:
  - Unique tools can be repaired with souls in the inventory, or with an anvil for greater efficiency.
  - A unique tool can be found on every island, unlockable for a certain amount of souls.
  - Some monsters drop special soul shards which can be used to upgrade your stats.
  - The ominous flower is crafted with a soul fragment from each biome.
  - It's called Breakwater cause you break things and there's also water.
  - Rocks do more damage and are better at breaking things than your fist.
  - If you want to travel to a new island, craft a boat station and build yourself a boat.
  - The battleship can destroy ocean rocks and enemies with its missile launcher.
  - Uranium tools are slightly more efficient than tungsten tools but they have much less durability.
  - Charms are special accessories that give unique passive effects. Some can be crafted and some can be found in dungeons
  - This loading screen takes way too long...
  - The soul tether can teleport you to your soul anchor, or it can bring you somewhere else...
  - When the plane crashed on the island, the cockpit was swallowed by a mysterious red puddle.
  - Looks like you guys were the only survivors of the plane crash.
  - In eldritch mode you can't come back after dying.
  - Uranium-235 chunks have to be purified in a uranium purifier before they can be used.
  - Monsters aren't scared of water on hard mode and above.
  - If you drown you will take some damage and be sent to the last place you touched land.
  - Monsters can't spawn on floor tiles - make sure to place some in your base.
  - In the volcanic caves, monsters roam around even during the day.
  - Crops don't need to be watered while it's raining.
  - The soul tracker won't light up if the unique tool on the island has already been claimed.
  - "\U0001F62D\U0001F494\U0001F64F\U0001F62D\U0001F63F"
  - You can normally have one catalyst active at a time, but rainbow catalysts can be used while a catalyst is already active.
  - Most boats come with tile slots, where you can place things such as chests and furnaces.
  - Dungeons can be located on the map with the soul tracker.
  - Tools and armor receive a random tier between 1 and 4 when crafted. Combine with an upgrade template in an anvil to increase the tier by 1.
  - Each biome has a different set of local resources. Be sure to plan ahead and bring the necessary items on long voyages.
  - Tools and armor can be repaired in an anvil by combining with the corresponding material.
  - Taiga biomes can sometimes have snowstorms, which can be deadly if you lack the means to warm yourself. Be sure to bring a campfire or torches.
  loadingTipText: {fileID: 6366217854911427364}
  worldBorder: {fileID: 1159631012}
